  Version 0.2.12 on dev (W37) logs per-phase startup timings (`lua`, `init`,
  `start`, `total` ms via `CLOCK_MONOTONIC`) at `TAM_LOG_INFO` right after
  the Wayland and IPC sockets are up, so `tam-session-bench startup` can
