  Version 0.2.11 on dev (W36) adds the opt-in bright green focus frame
  and a configured manual locker. Tamlinux selects a three-logical-pixel
  border and tam-hide. Native headless tests passed (794 checks).
  Physical focus, scaling and authenticated unlock await candidate Test.

  Version 0.2.10 (W35): implements GPU renderer-loss recovery
  (R1 finding 11, Tamlinux 0.7.0 Milestone 9). Listens to
  `renderer->events.lost`, defers recovery to an idle source so wlroots
  destroys the old renderer cleanly outside `wl_signal_emit_mutable`,
  recreates `wlr_renderer` and `wlr_allocator`, updates
  `wlr_compositor_set_renderer`, resets cached toplevel capture sources,
  re-initializes rendering on every active output, and re-arms the listener.
  Verified by back-to-back double-reset checks in `test_input_headless`
  (772/772) and installed locally at `~/.local/bin/tam-pane`.

